  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u9c76f256\" id=\"u9c76f256\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45a20a76\" id=\"u45a20a76\">2026年1月</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"BJy3y\" id=\"BJy3y\"><span data-lake-id=\"u350ba580\" id=\"u350ba580\">一面</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ud21920c0\" id=\"ud21920c0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u388a6f80\" id=\"u388a6f80\">25分钟项目 + 15分钟八股 + 20min算法</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9893b1cd\" id=\"u9893b1cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b5ebab6\" id=\"u8b5ebab6\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1ec3ade7\" id=\"u1ec3ade7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4cfed5df\" id=\"u4cfed5df\">1.自我介绍</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udf074826\" id=\"udf074826\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0c93991c\" id=\"u0c93991c\">2.介绍一下实习期间的难点 15min</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua4280bff\" id=\"ua4280bff\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae6c917a\" id=\"uae6c917a\">3.介绍一下channel </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3aa9b1c2\" id=\"u3aa9b1c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6859389\" id=\"ub6859389\">4.介绍一下context包</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6f031c5a\" id=\"u6f031c5a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b3d1474\" id=\"u5b3d1474\">5.如何防止goroutinue泄漏</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5f4d0438\" id=\"u5f4d0438\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3cfdde9e\" id=\"u3cfdde9e\">6.redis使用过哪些数据结构？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u15fa564f\" id=\"u15fa564f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d8e7f0d\" id=\"u6d8e7f0d\">7.介绍一下innodb的索引b+树</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9146299d\" id=\"u9146299d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u88c16412\" id=\"u88c16412\">8.索引失效的场景</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u635813bb\" id=\"u635813bb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u064b12e0\" id=\"u064b12e0\">分库分表的时候id怎么处理？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u259c77db\" id=\"u259c77db\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf423a7a2\" id=\"uf423a7a2\">9.你的AI项目历史上下文有没有做截断处理</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u063dc73d\" id=\"u063dc73d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub98d1b4b\" id=\"ub98d1b4b\">10.你的propmt是怎么处理的</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua3aecc0b\" id=\"ua3aecc0b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5655133\" id=\"ue5655133\">11.平时使用哪些AI编程工具？？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4e681b48\" id=\"u4e681b48\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2ca0c711\" id=\"u2ca0c711\">算法 lc LCR 087复原IP地址（思路对的边界处理有问题，估计挂了）</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u37eb59c7\" id=\"u37eb59c7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b160965\" id=\"u0b160965\">​</span><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"v9rma\" id=\"v9rma\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e0d0385\" id=\"u3e0d0385\">二面：</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u380c4746\" id=\"u380c4746\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ee07f75\" id=\"u3ee07f75\">你认为go和python哪个更适合做大模型？</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufb3e28aa\" id=\"ufb3e28aa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0639f9d0\" id=\"u0639f9d0\">实习15分钟</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u20a17271\" id=\"u20a17271\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75577039\" id=\"u75577039\">讲解一下HTTP和TCP的区别</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u796ce3b4\" id=\"u796ce3b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc916a10e\" id=\"uc916a10e\">如何理解HTTP的无状态</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6b5b0124\" id=\"u6b5b0124\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f3fcd24\" id=\"u4f3fcd24\">为什么我们常说HTTP是短连接 TCP是长连接</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7fc5b25e\" id=\"u7fc5b25e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda5d0b56\" id=\"uda5d0b56\">浏览器DNS啥的</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua172d65d\" id=\"ua172d65d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07b0dbee\" id=\"u07b0dbee\">RESTFULL</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3218e9f8\" id=\"u3218e9f8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d30989c\" id=\"u0d30989c\">GIN框架的middleware</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u81859d68\" id=\"u81859d68\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufce835c4\" id=\"ufce835c4\">gorm框架</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue438f86b\" id=\"ue438f86b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u585ff972\" id=\"u585ff972\">​</span><br></p>",
